<title>MEXICO: Hilasal Mexicana to pay share dividend.</title>
<headline>Hilasal Mexicana to pay share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican textile firm Hilasal Mexicana SA said Wednesday it will pay a dividend of 0.46 peso per share in circulation from December 16.</p>
<p>In information sent to the Mexican Stock Exchange, the company said the dividend payment was approved by the annual general meeting held Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Cecilia Cardenas +525 728-9552</p>
